[[Whiptail Devourer]]s are common foes infesting the shattered countryside of [[Ascalon]]. They attack primarily by shooting projectiles with their tails. Like all [[devourer]]s, they are often hidden beneath the surface of the ground, bursting from their hiding place to ambush unsuspecting prey.

